{"title":"Mossback Ancient","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 50 Mossback that attacks with crush (melee). It will not attack first.</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (16.7% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/mossback-ancient\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mossback-ancient?lv=49\">Lv 49 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mossback-ancient?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>2</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mossback-ancient?lv=49\" title=\"Pick level 49\"><td><b>49</b></td><td>290</td><td>31.5</td><td>2,450</td><td class=\"muted\">870 · 44.1 · 7,350</td><td>3</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mossback-ancient?lv=50\" title=\"Pick level 50\"><td><b>50</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>303</td><td>32</td><td>2,500</td><td class=\"muted\">909 · 44.8 · 7,500</td><td>2</td><td>in the wilds around 2269, 1480</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-378.2px,-2089.5px)\"><img src=\"tiles/4/0/7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:1792px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/0/8.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:2048px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/1/7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:1792px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/1/8.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:2048px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/2/7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:1792px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/2/8.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:2048px\"><i style=\"left:437.3px;top:2134.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:228.9px;top:2140.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:243.8px;top:2167.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:315.5px;top:2037.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:381.8px;top:2096.8px\"></i></div><figcaption>Sunken Avenue</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Avenue\">Sunken Avenue</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2269, 1480 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"mossback-ancient\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Mossback: <a href=\"#/monster/mossback\">Mossback</a> <span class=\"muted\">(48)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/cffbdf7d80a1f1840dde.w